    "detailed_description": "<h1>If you encounter performance issues, please give it a try! (White screen, unsmooth operation)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please try:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option \u2192 Reduce Weather Particles\uff1aON\u3001Improve GPU\uff1aON </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be due to not being assigned to high performance mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please try the following steps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Open NVIDIA Control Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Go to 'Manage 3D settings'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. In the 'Program Settings' tab, find or add a program named 'game.exe'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Set it to use the high-performance graphics processor by default.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing these steps, please restart the program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AMD: For AMD graphics cards, set the game to 'High Performance' in AMD Radeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows 11 Integrated Graphics: In Windows 11 settings, find 'Display Adapter', </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >click on 'App Custom Options', then select 'Add an app', </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >browse and select the game shortcut on the desktop, and set it to 'High Performance Mode' (if you can directly search for 'game.exe', there is no need to add it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another method of setting: Change the resolution to the lowest within the game and then close the game. In Steam, right-click on the game and select &quot;Browse Local Files.&quot; In the opened folder, find the game.exe file, right-click it, select Properties, go to the Compatibility tab, and check the box for &quot;Run this program in compatibility mode for.&quot; Run the game in windowed or full-screen mode, which can significantly reduce the occurrence of white screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawback: You will need to right-click on game.exe and recheck the compatibility mode each time you reopen the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/8edbf0583ae75c1ac32898b391ebf5f0.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/8edbf0583ae75c1ac32898b391ebf5f0.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/8edbf0583ae75c1ac32898b391ebf5f0.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A this game that seamlessly integrates TRPG, SLG, Idle,Rogue,gacha,anime style. Crafted by genuine players, Prepare to embark on a journey that showcases the full extent of my intellect, imagination, and sincerity. Gather your strength, forge bonds, and ascend to the throne of kingship\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll find yourself immersed in an original fantasy realm, gathering strength, unraveling truths, and defying destiny...</strong>(This is not an R18 game)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7This game is somewhat complex. you can try the free demo version first</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> (by copying the save folder from the game directory to inherit the demo save data\uff09</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/599e0fec034c964a4cd9003bb2d01c5e.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/599e0fec034c964a4cd9003bb2d01c5e.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/599e0fec034c964a4cd9003bb2d01c5e.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbBringing forth a plethora of possibilities, catering to diverse styles of character construction.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you have the freedom to assemble an array of powers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing forth a plethora of possibilities, catering to diverse styles of character construction. Within the game's realm, you have the freedom to assemble an array of powers, drawing inspiration from a build system rooted in tabletop role-playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/561aeda332d7bdbc2f22cf4b5e94b604.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/561aeda332d7bdbc2f22cf4b5e94b604.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/561aeda332d7bdbc2f22cf4b5e94b604.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbFantasy Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/e86bb1f31ecd65186e90edde0b54b204.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/e86bb1f31ecd65186e90edde0b54b204.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/e86bb1f31ecd65186e90edde0b54b204.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Embark on a breathtaking fantasy odyssey, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >blending the allure of rogue elements with the strategic depth of tabletop role-playing adventures. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >success or failure hinges not merely on the roll of the dice but on the myriad abilities your character possesses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fate is not solely dictated by chance; rather, it is shaped by your character's prowess, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >allowing you to wield various abilities to alter outcomes and carve your own destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbBattle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/868d68629e123f4e2615200c5eab2935.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/868d68629e123f4e2615200c5eab2935.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/868d68629e123f4e2615200c5eab2935.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in meticulously detailed battles within this game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >its unique tactical turn-based combat system unfolds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this system, a plethora of reactive and additional actions are possible, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >incorporating intricate timing mechanics and meticulous action management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, numerous &quot;interactive actions&quot; are unlocked only when facing specific enemies or encountering particular scenarios. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These interactive actions, referred to as &quot;combat interactions,&quot; include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Engaging in dialogue with sentient adversaries, potentially ending the conflict peacefully or even recruiting them as new allies.\u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Employing a &quot;tail severing&quot; maneuver to neutralize a foe's formidable appendage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Exploiting an enemy's petrifying gaze to one's advantage, potentially inducing self-petrification through mirrored reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Unveiling a demon's true name through &quot;knowledge,&quot; then utilizing &quot;chanting&quot; to vanquish or weaken it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game harbors additional combat systems:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 For instance, there's the nuanced &quot;debate warfare,&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which involves managing counterarguments and social skill checks to simulate a debate scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Additionally, there's the imperative of cultivating armies and sustaining morale in the realm of &quot;military combat,&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > necessitating ongoing attention to training and morale outside of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/d85ab12c87b0c3689d60f08d92bd329b.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/d85ab12c87b0c3689d60f08d92bd329b.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/d85ab12c87b0c3689d60f08d92bd329b.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbNurture relationships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this world brimming with challenges, you are never alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interact with loved ones and companions, embark on side quests, delve deeper into understanding, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and strengthen bonds. Through these interactions, you not only deepen your connections but also foster personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/a51354a2aa5e35d5ef6c9b7000da6bdd.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/a51354a2aa5e35d5ef6c9b7000da6bdd.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/a51354a2aa5e35d5ef6c9b7000da6bdd.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbIdle develop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game of incremental development and time management, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where various mechanics demand a slower pace, allowing for a gradual exploration of its delights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you discover your own joy and immersion within my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/c00728f87b9e1dc366d92e911dc86dcd.poster.avif?t=1738562671\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/c00728f87b9e1dc366d92e911dc86dcd.webm?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919560/extras/c00728f87b9e1dc366d92e911dc86dcd.mp4?t=1738562671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
